        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① CloudFront (WAF · ACM 부착)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;WAF 는 별도 홉이 아니라 CloudFront 에 붙은 Web ACL(us-east-1): 캐시 조회보다 먼저 평가, 차단은 캐시·오리진 미도달. allow-loadgen(JMeter IP set) → 관리형 3 → rate-all IP당 5분 2,000 → rate-booking /visits/new 100. 로그 → CloudWatch Logs aws-waf-logs-mc. 멘토링 '관리 어려움' 의견은 있었으나 팀 결정으로 유지(enable_waf=true). ACM us-east-1 · TLSv1.2_2021 · HTTP→HTTPS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="252" width="600" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① Behavior 분기 → 정적 S3 / ALB / 점검 S3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;오리진 3개. /static/* · /images/*(랜딩 css·이미지·hero 영상) = S3 mc-static(OAC) — apply 가 src/main/webapp/resources·images 를 동기화, CachingOptimized 1일 → Hit 면 엣지, Miss 면 S3(Apache 안 거침). /petclinic/resources/* · /petclinic/images/*(WAR 안) = ALB 캐시. * = CachingDisabled + AllViewer → 매번 ALB. /maintenance.html = 점검 S3 OAC, 오리진 5xx → 503(오리진 그룹 failover). 정적 교체 후 invalidation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="100" as="geometry" />
