        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;② WEB → Internal ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Apache 2.4 mod_proxy_http(mod_jk 아님 — AJP 는 ALB 통과 불가). / = test 브랜치 WAR 의 index.html + resources·images 를 부팅 시 /var/www/html/static 으로 복사해 직접 서빙 · /petclinic/ → 302 / (hero 1회) · ProxyPass /petclinic/ → :8080 · ProxyPreserveHost On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend">
