        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;③ Internal ALB → WAS ×2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;mc-alb-internal :8080 → mc-tg-was /petclinic/ 10s·2/3. SG 체인: sg-alb-internal 8080 ← sg-web · sg-was 8080 ← sg-alb-internal. WEB 은 WAS IP 를 모름 → WAS 교체·증설 시 WEB 무변경&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend">
